Z||000000||rogergarrison||05-31-2001||06:05 PM||||<BR>Ok, these topics seem to generate a lot of responses. What everyones take of the boomerang UFO seen over Phoenix a couple of years back? The government said (as they say they proved) that they were flares dropped in a military practice mission. There are a number of contradictions to rule that out. I dropped flares myself, and they dont stay in position for more than a few minutes. They fall to the ground, sometimes even by chute. These lights identified as on a solid boomerang shaped opject moved back and forth across the state for several hundred miles. They were observed first around 8 pm and were continuously seen untill after 1030 pm....||||reg||1
